},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"合肥"},"coord":[117.23,31.82]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"安徽合肥人，淮军将领、两广总督；在两广推行洋务与海防建设。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.《洋务运动史》"}],"tags":["人物","洋务","督抚"],"relations":[{"type":"subordinate_of","target":"person.lihongzhang","note":{"zh-Hans":"淮军树军统领，后任两广总督"},"source":["source.《洋务运动史》"]},{"type":"custom:director_of","target":"institution.guangdong-haijun"}]},{"id":"person.chonghou","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"崇厚"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1826","end":"1893","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"北京"},"coord":[116.4,39.92]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"满洲镶黄旗人，三口通商大臣；创办天津机器局，后因伊犁交涉被革。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.《洋务运动史》"}],"tags":["人物","洋务","外交"],"relations":[{"type":"participant","target":"event.1867.天津机器局"},{"type":"founded","target":"institution.tianjin-jiqiju"}]},{"id":"person.ying-baoshi","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"应宝时"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"应敏斋"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1821","end":"1890","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"永康"},"coord":[120.04,28.89]}]},"nationality":"china","summary":{"zh-Hans":"字敏斋，浙江永康人，道光二十四年（1844）举人。1864—1869 年任苏松太道（上海道），任内于 1864 年 5 月设洋泾浜北首理事衙门，派华官到英国领事馆会同英美副领事审理租界华人案件，是会审公廨的前身；1868 年又与英美领事订《洋泾浜设官会审章程》。后升江苏按察使、布政使，一度署江苏巡抚。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.应宝时"},{"ref":"source.wiki.会审公廨"}],"tags":["法律","上海","晚清"],"relations":[{"type":"participant","target":"event.1869.会审公廨"}]}]}